cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the pretrained weights, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Predictive dosimetry for [177Lu]Lu-PSMA therapy: virtual cohort, Monte Carlo dose and pre-therapy prediction updated with a single SPECT"
abstract: >-
  A virtual cohort built from public PSMA PET/CT studies, a physiologically based pharmacokinetic (PBPK) model,
  GATE Monte Carlo dose calculation and a SwinUNETR network that predicts voxel kinetic parameters with uncertainty
  from PET/CT before therapy. The prediction is personalised with a single post-therapy SPECT (Bayesian update on
  volumes of interest, differentiable PBPK update and test-time optimisation), validated on a frozen test split and
  on real 177Lu-DOTATATE patient data.
authors:
